---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '@/components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '@/components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Launching Hard Rock Bet Across Six States" description="A Field Vision case study - Launching Hard Rock Bet Across Six States">
  <Header slot="header" />

  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════
     SECTION 1: HERO
     ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <div>
      <span class="section-tag">Case Study</span>
      <h1>Launching Hard Rock Bet Across Six States</h1>
      <p class="hero-desc">
        When the Seminole Tribe of Florida secured a historic gaming compact, they needed a brand and marketing engine to launch the first legal sportsbook in the state — and then scale it nationally. As VP of Brand Marketing, I built Hard Rock Bet from brand inception through six state launches, exceeding acquisition forecasts by 232%.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-meta">
        <div class="hero-meta-item">
          <span class="hero-meta-label">Company</span>
          <span class="hero-meta-value">Hard Rock Digital</span>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-meta-item">
          <span class="hero-meta-label">Industry</span>
          <span class="hero-meta-value">Sports Betting / Gaming</span>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-meta-item">
          <span class="hero-meta-label">Scope</span>
          <span class="hero-meta-value">Multi-State (6 Markets)</span>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-meta-item">
          <span class="hero-meta-label">Focus</span>
          <span class="hero-meta-value">Brand Launch &amp; Growth</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-image" style="padding:0; background:none; border:none;">
                <img src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/d84514_dbb68c529f1145b08893fe4cbfa525e2~mv2.png" alt="Hard Rock Bet marketing collage" style="width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; border-radius:var(--radius);" />
            </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════
     SECTION 2: RESULTS STRIP
     ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="results-strip">
  <div class="results-strip-inner">
    <div class="result-stat">
      <div class="result-number">+232%</div>
      <div class="result-label">Exceeded Acquisition Forecasts</div>
    </div>
    <div class="result-stat">
      <div class="result-number">6</div>
      <div class="result-label">State Launches</div>
    </div>
    <div class="result-stat">
      <div class="result-number">+17%</div>
      <div class="result-label">ARPU Above Target</div>
    </div>
    <div class="result-stat">
      <div class="result-number">1st</div>
      <div class="result-label">Legal Sportsbook in Florida</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════
     SECTION 3: THE SITUATION
     ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="content-section">
  <span class="section-tag">The Situation</span>
  <h2>Building a Sportsbook Brand from Scratch in a Crowded Market</h2>
  <p>
    The U.S. sports betting market was exploding with well-funded competitors like DraftKings and FanDuel spending billions on customer acquisition. Hard Rock Digital needed to launch a sportsbook that could compete immediately — but the brand, marketing infrastructure, and go-to-market strategy didn't exist yet.
  </p>
  <div class="challenge-grid">
    <ul class="challenge-points">
      <li class="challenge-point">
        <div class="challenge-icon">1</div>
        <div class="challenge-text">
          <strong>Entering a market dominated by well-funded incumbents.</strong> DraftKings and FanDuel had already spent billions on brand awareness and customer acquisition, making market entry extremely competitive.
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="challenge-point">
        <div class="challenge-icon">2</div>
        <div class="challenge-text">
          <strong>No existing sportsbook brand or marketing infrastructure.</strong> Hard Rock Bet needed everything built from the ground up — brand identity, creative systems, media strategy, and acquisition engine.
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="challenge-point">
        <div class="challenge-icon">3</div>
        <div class="challenge-text">
          <strong>Massive Florida launch with national ambitions.</strong> The first legal sportsbook in Florida was a high-stakes debut, with immediate plans to expand across five additional states.
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="challenge-point">
        <div class="challenge-icon">4</div>
        <div class="challenge-text">
          <strong>Retention was the real battleground.</strong> In a category where sign-up bonuses drive switching, building lasting engagement beyond the first bet was critical to long-term profitability.
        </div>
      </li>
    </ul>
    <div class="challenge-callout">
      <span class="section-tag">The Mandate</span>
      <blockquote>
        Build a sportsbook brand from scratch that can compete with billion-dollar incumbents — then scale it across six states while exceeding acquisition and revenue targets.
      </blockquote>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════
     SECTION 4: THE APPROACH
     ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<div class="approach-bg">
  <div class="content-section">
    <span class="section-tag">The Approach</span>
    <h2>Win the Launch Moment, Then Build Beyond the First Bet</h2>
    <p>
      The strategy rested on two pillars: dominate each state launch window to capture outsized market share, then build engagement systems that drove long-term value beyond the initial sign-up bonus. Every campaign was designed to move bettors from trial to habitual engagement.
    </p>
    <div class="approach-phases">
      <div class="phase-card">
        <div class="phase-number">01</div>
        <div class="phase-title">Win the Launch Moment</div>
        <div class="phase-desc">
          Orchestrated high-impact, coordinated launches in each state — combining brand awareness blitzes, strategic media buys, and cultural tentpole activations to capture maximum attention in compressed launch windows.
        </div>
        <div class="phase-tools">
          <a href="/services/go-to-market" class="phase-tool">Go-to-Market Strategy →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="phase-card">
        <div class="phase-number">02</div>
        <div class="phase-title">Build Engagement Beyond the First Bet</div>
        <div class="phase-desc">
          Identified key activation behaviors — second bet within 48 hours, betting across multiple sports, using live in-play betting — and built campaigns specifically designed to drive these high-value actions.
        </div>
        <div class="phase-tools">
          <a href="/services/growth-marketing" class="phase-tool">Growth &amp; Lifecycle Marketing →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="phase-card">
        <div class="phase-number">03</div>
        <div class="phase-title">Scalable Multi-State Playbook</div>
        <div class="phase-desc">
          Built a repeatable launch framework that could be localized for each market — adapting messaging, media mix, and cultural hooks for Florida, Arizona, New Jersey, and beyond while maintaining brand consistency.
        </div>
        <div class="phase-tools">
          <a href="/services/integrated-marketing" class="phase-tool">Integrated Marketing →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="phase-card">
        <div class="phase-number">04</div>
        <div class="phase-title">Data-Driven Acquisition Engine</div>
        <div class="phase-desc">
          Built performance marketing infrastructure that connected brand spend to acquisition outcomes, enabling real-time optimization across channels and markets. Measured every dollar against customer lifetime value, not just sign-up volume.
        </div>
        <div class="phase-tools">
          <a href="/services/content-creator-marketing" class="phase-tool">Content &amp; Creator Marketing →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>



<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════
     SECTION 6: BEFORE / AFTER
     ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="before-after">
  <div class="before-after-inner">
    <span class="section-tag">Transformation</span>
    <h2>Before &amp; After Hard Rock Bet</h2>
    <div class="ba-grid">
      <div class="ba-column ba-before">
        <div class="ba-label">Before</div>
        <div class="ba-item">
          <div class="ba-bullet"></div>
          <div class="ba-item-text">No sportsbook brand, identity, or marketing infrastructure</div>
        </div>
        <div class="ba-item">
          <div class="ba-bullet"></div>
          <div class="ba-item-text">Entering a market dominated by DraftKings and FanDuel with multi-billion-dollar head starts</div>
        </div>
        <div class="ba-item">
          <div class="ba-bullet"></div>
          <div class="ba-item-text">No legal sports betting in Florida — the third-largest state by population</div>
        </div>
        <div class="ba-item">
          <div class="ba-bullet"></div>
          <div class="ba-item-text">Acquisition-focused category with minimal retention strategy</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="ba-column ba-after">
        <div class="ba-label">After</div>
        <div class="ba-item">
          <div class="ba-bullet"></div>
          <div class="ba-item-text">Full brand built from scratch — identity, creative systems, media strategy, and launch playbook</div>
        </div>
        <div class="ba-item">
          <div class="ba-bullet"></div>
          <div class="ba-item-text">Exceeded acquisition forecasts by 232% across six state launches</div>
        </div>
        <div class="ba-item">
          <div class="ba-bullet"></div>
          <div class="ba-item-text">First legal sportsbook launched in Florida with massive market capture</div>
        </div>
        <div class="ba-item">
          <div class="ba-bullet"></div>
          <div class="ba-item-text">ARPU 17% above target through engagement-first retention strategy</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════
     SECTION 7: RESULTS DEEP DIVE
     ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="results-section">
  <div class="results-inner">
    <span class="section-tag">Results</span>
    <h2 style="font-family:'Anton',sans-serif; font-size:clamp(28px,3.5vw,40px); text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--dark); margin-bottom:8px;">
      The Numbers Tell the Story
    </h2>
    <p style="font-size:16px; color:rgba(33,54,33,0.65); max-width:600px;">
      A brand built from zero to multi-state sportsbook powerhouse — with results that shattered forecasts.
    </p>
    <div class="results-grid">
      <div class="result-card">
        <div class="result-card-metric">+232%</div>
        <div class="result-card-label">Exceeded Acquisition Forecasts</div>
        <div class="result-card-desc">
          Customer acquisition exceeded internal forecasts by 232% across all markets, driven by high-impact launch campaigns and performance marketing optimization.
        </div>
        <div class="result-card-bar"><div class="result-card-bar-fill" style="width:95%"></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="result-card">
        <div class="result-card-metric">6</div>
        <div class="result-card-label">State Launches</div>
        <div class="result-card-desc">
          Successfully launched Hard Rock Bet across six states including Florida, Arizona, and New Jersey — using a repeatable playbook localized for each market.
        </div>
        <div class="result-card-bar"><div class="result-card-bar-fill" style="width:80%"></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="result-card">
        <div class="result-card-metric">+17%</div>
        <div class="result-card-label">ARPU Above Target</div>
        <div class="result-card-desc">
          Average Revenue Per User exceeded targets by 17%, validating the engagement-first strategy that focused on activation behaviors beyond the initial sign-up bonus.
        </div>
        <div class="result-card-bar"><div class="result-card-bar-fill" style="width:75%"></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="result-card">
        <div class="result-card-metric">1st</div>
        <div class="result-card-label">Legal Sportsbook in Florida</div>
        <div class="result-card-desc">
          Launched the first legal sportsbook in the state of Florida — the third-largest state by population — capturing significant first-mover advantage in a massive market.
        </div>
        <div class="result-card-bar"><div class="result-card-bar-fill" style="width:100%"></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════
     SECTION 8: IMPACT
     ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="impact-section">
  <span class="section-tag">Impact</span>
  <h2>From Brand Inception to Multi-State Sportsbook</h2>
  <p>
    Hard Rock Bet proved that a well-built brand with a clear strategy could compete against entrenched incumbents — even in a category where competitors had multi-billion-dollar head starts. By combining high-impact launch moments with retention-focused engagement systems, the brand didn't just acquire customers; it built lasting value.
  </p>
  <p>
    The two-pillar strategy — win the launch moment, then build beyond the first bet — created a repeatable model for multi-state expansion that consistently outperformed forecasts in every market entered.
  </p>
  <div class="impact-callout">
    <div class="impact-icon">🎰</div>
    <div class="impact-text">
      Hard Rock Bet went from brand inception to the first legal sportsbook in Florida — then scaled across six states while exceeding acquisition forecasts by 232% and delivering ARPU 17% above target.
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════
     SECTION 9: SERVICES USED
     ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="services-used">
  <span class="section-tag">Capabilities Applied</span>
  <h2 style="font-family:'Anton',sans-serif; font-size:clamp(24px,3vw,32px); text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--dark); margin-bottom:8px;">
    What This Took
  </h2>
  <div class="services-pills">
    <a href="/services/go-to-market" class="service-pill">Go-to-Market Strategy</a>
    <a href="/services/integrated-marketing" class="service-pill">Integrated Marketing</a>
    <a href="/services/content-creator-marketing" class="service-pill">Content &amp; Creator Marketing</a>
    <a href="/services/growth-marketing" class="service-pill">Growth &amp; Lifecycle Marketing</a>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════
     SECTION 10: CTA
     ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="cta-section">
  <h2>Ready to Build Your Growth Engine?</h2>
  <p>
    Every engagement starts with a conversation. Let's talk about where you are, where you want to go, and how to get there.
  </p>
  <a href="#" class="cta-btn">Book a Strategy Call</a>
</section>


    <div class="lightbox-overlay" id="heroLightbox" onclick="this.classList.remove('active')">
    <span class="lightbox-close">&times;</span>
    <img id="lightboxImg" src="" alt="" />
</div>
<script>
    (function() {
        var heroImg = document.querySelector('.hero-image img');
        if (!heroImg) return;
        var overlay = document.getElementById('heroLightbox');
        var lbImg = document.getElementById('lightboxImg');
        heroImg.addEventListener('click', function() {
            lbImg.src = heroImg.src;
            lbImg.alt = heroImg.alt;
            overlay.classList.add('active');
        });
        document.addEventListener('keydown', function(e) {
            if (e.key === 'Escape') overlay.classList.remove('active');
        });
    })();
</script>

<script>(function(){var hb=document.querySelector('.hamburger'),mn=document.querySelector('.mobile-nav');if(!hb||!mn)return;hb.addEventListener('click',function(){hb.classList.toggle('active');mn.classList.toggle('open');hb.setAttribute('aria-expanded',hb.classList.contains('active')?'true':'false');document.body.style.overflow=mn.classList.contains('open')?'hidden':'';}); document.querySelectorAll('.mobile-nav a').forEach(function(l){l.addEventListener('click',function(){hb.classList.remove('active');mn.classList.remove('open');hb.setAttribute('aria-expanded','false');document.body.style.overflow='';});});})();</script>

  <Footer slot="footer" />
</BaseLayout>

<style is:global>
/* ─── SECTION LABEL ─── */
.section-tag {
    font-family: 'Satoshi', sans-serif;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 2.5px;
    color: var(--tan);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    display: block;
}
/* ─── HERO ─── */
.hero {
    background: var(--dark);
    color: var(--cream);
    padding: 152px 24px 60px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
}
.hero-inner {
    max-width: var(--max-w);
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 48px;
    align-items: center;
}
.hero .section-tag { color: var(--accent); }
.hero h1 {
    font-family: 'Anton', sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(36px, 5vw, 56px);
    line-height: 1.05;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
}
.hero-desc {
    font-size: 16px;
    color: rgba(239,234,211,0.8);
    max-width: 500px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
    line-height: 1.7;
}
.hero-meta { display: flex; gap: 24px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.hero-meta-item { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; }
.hero-meta-label {
    font-size: 10px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    color: var(--tan);
    font-weight: 700;
}
.hero-meta-value { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--cream); }
.hero-image {
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    overflow: hidden;
    background: rgba(239,234,211,0.08);
    border: 1px solid rgba(239,234,211,0.12);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: var(--tan);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
}
/* ─── RESULTS STRIP ─── */
.results-strip { background: var(--accent); padding: 40px 24px; }
.results-strip-inner {
    max-width: var(--max-w);
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 32px;
    text-align: center;
}
.result-number {
    font-family: 'Anton', sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 44px);
    color: var(--dark);
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
}
.result-label {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    color: rgba(33,54,33,0.7);
}
/* ─── CONTENT SECTIONS ─── */
.content-section {
    padding: 72px 24px;
    max-width: var(--max-w);
    margin: 0 auto;
}
.content-section h2 {
    font-family: 'Anton', sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(28px, 3.5vw, 40px);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--dark);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    line-height: 1.1;
}
.content-section p {
    font-size: 16px;
    color: rgba(33,54,33,0.75);
    max-width: 720px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    line-height: 1.8;
}
/* ─── THE SITUATION ─── */
.challenge-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr;
    gap: 48px;
    align-items: start;
    margin-top: 32px;
}
.challenge-points {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
}
.challenge-point { display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: flex-start; }
.challenge-icon {
    width: 36px;
    height: 36px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--dark);
    color: var(--accent);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 16px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 2px;
    font-weight: 700;
}
.challenge-text { font-size: 15px; color: var(--dark); line-height: 1.6; }
.challenge-text strong { font-weight: 700; }
.challenge-callout {
    background: var(--dark);
    color: var(--cream);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 32px;
}
.challenge-callout .section-tag { color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: 16px; }
.challenge-callout blockquote {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-style: italic;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    color: rgba(239,234,211,0.9);
}
.challenge-callout cite {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-style: normal;
    color: var(--tan);
    font-weight: 600;
}
/* ─── OUR APPROACH ─── */
.approach-bg { background: var(--dark); padding: 72px 24px; }
.approach-bg .content-section { padding: 0; max-width: var(--max-w); margin: 0 auto; }
.approach-bg .section-tag { color: var(--accent); }
.approach-bg h2 { color: var(--cream); }
.approach-bg p { color: rgba(239,234,211,0.7); }
.approach-phases {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 20px;
    margin-top: 40px;
}
.phase-card {
    background: rgba(239,234,211,0.06);
    border: 1px solid rgba(239,234,211,0.1);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 28px;
    transition: border-color 0.3s;
}
.phase-card:hover { border-color: var(--accent); }
.phase-number {
    font-family: 'Anton', sans-serif;
    font-size: 36px;
    color: var(--accent);
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
}
.phase-title { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--cream); margin-bottom: 8px; }
.phase-desc { font-size: 13px; color: rgba(239,234,211,0.6); line-height: 1.6; }
.phase-tools { margin-top: 14px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; }
.phase-tool {
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    padding: 4px 10px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    background: rgba(165,219,93,0.12);
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background 0.3s, color 0.3s;
    display: inline-block;
}
a.phase-tool:hover { background: var(--accent); color: var(--dark); }
/* ─── VISUAL GALLERY ─── */
.gallery-section {
    padding: 72px 24px;
    max-width: var(--max-w);
    margin: 0 auto;
}
.gallery-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr;
    grid-template-rows: auto auto;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-top: 32px;
}
.gallery-item {
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--dark);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: var(--tan);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    border: 1px solid rgba(33,54,33,0.1);
    position: relative;
}
.gallery-item.large { grid-row: span 2; min-height: 380px; }
.gallery-item.small { min-height: 180px; }
.gallery-caption {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    padding: 16px 20px;
    background: linear-gradient(transparent, rgba(33,54,33,0.85));
    color: var(--cream);
    font-size: 12px;
    text-transform: none;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.5;
}
/* ─── BEFORE / AFTER ─── */
.before-after { background: var(--dark); padding: 72px 24px; }
.before-after-inner { max-width: var(--max-w); margin: 0 auto; }
.before-after .section-tag { color: var(--accent); }
.before-after h2 {
    color: var(--cream);
    font-family: 'Anton', sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(28px,3.5vw,40px);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
}
.ba-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 32px; }
.ba-label {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    padding-bottom: 12px;
}
.ba-before .ba-label { color: var(--tan); border-bottom: 2px solid rgba(185,169,143,0.3); }
.ba-after .ba-label { color: var(--accent); border-bottom: 2px solid var(--accent); }
